        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "An accountancy firm in Ireland with a new website that nobody visited and a partner who answered the same tax questions by phone every week."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A site rebuild had lost 73% of the firm's old rankings. Enquiries had dropped to a handful a month, and the firm's expertise lived in the partners' heads."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Recovery first: redirects, lost pages restored, technical fixes",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "A deadline calendar for every Irish tax filing, with a page per deadline",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Weekly articles answering real client questions, reviewed by a partner",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Structured data and clear answers so AI search tools cite the firm",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Service pages rewritten around what people search, not what the firm calls things",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Organic traffic is up 167% on the pre-rebuild peak and the firm takes around ninety enquiries a month from search."
        }
      ]
    },
